description:
PRD §18. The fungus lane is built and tested against a scripted fetch only (the cloud session has no JEV_API_KEY). From a machine with the key:
- run the colony page with Garden painted on both nests, Jev on, each aim preset (Unite, Spread, Peace); read real tokens per fungal situation from the ledger (estimate ≈ 323);
- compare time-to-unified and deaths against the local rule (= each strain's default) on seeds 1–3;
- note whether Jev's per-situation placements differ from the defaults at all, and where.
Four hand-written situational rules lost to the defaults (PRD §18); this is the test of whether the per-host situation earns its place.
